"description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c13103b82d002d99\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIn the European Union, <strong>over 2000 suicides on railway premises were reported in 2020.</strong> Identifying individuals&#x27; behavioral and location patterns just before they die or attempt to die by train suicide (ITS) is critical for effective prevention ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c13103b82d002d99\">>>", "published": "January 30, 2023", "siteName": "onlinelibrary.wiley.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"29a669f6aa61ac16\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nUQAM | CRISE | Railway suicides | Railway suicide in the world\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"29a669f6aa61ac16\">>>", "url": "https://railwaysuicideprevention.com/railway-fatalities/railway-suicide-in-the-world.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1a26a0f82e97dc8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRailway suicides vary from country to country. Therefore, one has to be very careful when drawing conclusions from analyses and preventive measures that have been developed elsewhere. It is also important to note that data in different countries do not necessarily use the same criteria for ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1a26a0f82e97dc8\">>>", "siteName": "railwaysuicideprevention.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2b739c44f920c18b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nStrategies for Reducing Suicide at Railroads: A Scoping Review of Evidence and Gaps - PMC\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2b739c44f920c18b\">>>", "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11765353/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7f3ce058324710e5\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nDistribution of 26 studies related to railways across ten countries. ... Histogram of publication years for the 26 evaluated manuscripts on prevention strategies related to railways. ... Histogram of average year of intervention implementation for 26 included studies. Quantitative findings were sparse across all interventions, as empirical studies typically concentrated on specific train lines or city regions and assessed only a small number of suicides.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7f3ce058324710e5\">>>", "siteName": "pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1776357833819}}
