than the number of fatalities despite the downward trend seen in the EU the past decade (2 357 in 2024 compared with 2 608 in 2014, <strong>-9.6%)</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e51388f8e29c6a5\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"December 16, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"79d522eeaa4fe2f7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">Railway safety statistics in the EU</span>\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"79d522eeaa4fe2f7\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Railway_safety_statistics_in_the_EU\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eda0ebef3a4254e4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>The highest decrease was observed between 2012 and 2013 (-6.7%)</strong> while the highest increase was observed between 2021 and 2022 (+7.5%). The number of suicides on railway premises has fallen consistently from 2017 to 2020 but registered a slight increase in 2021 (+1.4%).\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eda0ebef3a4254e4\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"62d7d91299d47e53\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStrategies for Reducing Suicide at Railroads: A Scoping Review of Evidence and Gaps - PMC\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"62d7d91299d47e53\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11765353/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"479e8f7e2e2150ad\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis review aims to systematically evaluate existing literature on reducing suicides along railroads, with specific focus on effectiveness, limitations, and research gaps in the current evidence base. Database searches were conducted in PubMed, ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"479e8f7e2e2150ad\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6e5caa0f8d05e03e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n﻿ | I Report on Railway Safety and Interoperability in the EU 2020\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6e5caa0f8d05e03e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.era.europa.eu/system/files/2022-10/Report%20on%20Railway%20Safety%20and%20Interoperability%20in%20the%20EU%202020.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"475eef984099afe0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFigure A-11: Passenger and driver fatality rates for different transport modes (EU-28, 2014-18) Onboard fatalities per billion passenger kilometers ... all railway undertakings. Trespasser fatalities (so as to exclude suicide fatalities) is also likely · to be an issue. Nevertheless, the comparability of data may be satisfactory for the given · purpose of an international benchmark. Lastly, the selection of countries used in the two\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"475eef984099afe0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.era.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb3937f3f940d7c0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSystematic review of research on railway and urban transit system suicides - ScienceDirect\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb3937f3f940d7c0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0165032715310119\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aa125df8631d2289\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAfter installation of the mid-track fencing in 2014, there was a <strong>62.5% reduction in the rate of suicides occurring at the intervention station</strong>. Compared to the six other control stations, the intervention station displayed a significant reduction ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aa125df8631d2289\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"December 29, 2015\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sciencedirect.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2aafa3516ac2d071\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUQAM | CRISE | Railway suicides | Railway suicide in the world\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2aafa3516ac2d071\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://railwaysuicideprevention.com/railway-fatalities/railway-suicide-in-the-world.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b94b6f10afd89fdb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLast update: Aug. 2018 · Railway suicides vary from country to country. Therefore, one has to be very careful when drawing conclusions from analyses and preventive measures that have been developed elsewhere. It is also important to note that data in different countries do not necessarily ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b94b6f10afd89fdb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"railwaysuicideprevention.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5690c6cb93961109\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBehavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides - Moritz - 2023 - Suicide and Life-Threatening Behavior - Wiley Online Library\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5690c6cb93961109\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6eccd966bd2aeafb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIn the European Union, <strong>over 2000 suicides on railway premises were reported in 2020.</strong> Identifying individuals&#x27; behavioral and location patterns just before they die or attempt to die by train suicide (ITS) is critical for effective prevention ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6eccd966bd2aeafb\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 30, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"onlinelibrary.wiley.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n